#: core/KexiCommandLineOptions.cpp:99
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "Open object of type 'object_type'\n"
#| "and name 'object_name' from specified project\n"
#| "on application start.\n"
#| "'object_type' is optional, if omitted - table\n"
#| "type is assumed.\n"
#| "Other object types can be query, report, form,\n"
#| "script (may be more or less, depending on your\n"
#| "plugins installed).\n"
#| "Use \"\" chars to specify names containing spaces.\n"
#| "Examples: --open MyTable,\n"
#| " --open query:\"My very big query\""
msgctxt "'open' command line option"
msgid ""
"Open object of type 'object_type' and name 'object_name' from specified "
"project on application start. 'object_type' is optional, if omitted - %1 "
"type is assumed. Other object types can be %2, %3, %4, %5. There may by more "
"or less types available depending on Kexi plugins installed.\n"
"Use \"\" characters to specify names containing spaces.\n"
"Examples: --open MyTable, --open %2:\"My very big query\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Abrir un obxecto de tipo «object_type»\n"
"e nome «object_name» do proxecto indicado\n"
"ao iniciar o aplicativo.\n"
"O «object_type» é opcional, sendo «table» (táboa)\n"
"o valor por omisión.\n"
"Outros posíbeis tipos son «query» (consulta),\n"
"«report» (informe), «form» (formulario), «script» (a\n"
"cantidade de tipos dispoñíbeis variará segundo os\n"
"complementos que teña instalados).\n"
"Empregue as comiñas dobres estándar, «\"», para\n"
"delimitar os nomes que conteñan espazos.\n"
"Velaquí algúns exemplos: «--open TaboaDeTraballo»,\n"
"«--open query:\"Unha gran consulta\"»."

#: core/KexiCommandLineOptions.cpp:110
#, fuzzy
